<title>USA: Neenah, Wis., won by Bernardi Sec.</title>
<headline>Neenah, Wis., won by Bernardi Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Sec. said it won $2.450 million of Neenah, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.99 percent.</p>
</text>
